flowchart LR
    H[Observed history before cutoff] --> N[Small neural parameter estimator]
    G[Global FSRS vector and bounds] --> N
    N --> W[Personal FSRS vector]
    W --> R[Replay prefix with those weights]
    R --> P[Predict later reviews before their outcomes]
    O[Later observed outcomes] --> L[Training loss or held-out score]
    P --> L
    L -. Training players only .-> N
